    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><br>Embark on an amazing journey with a brave kitten, and help him find his lost friend. Test your skills and solve well-crafted puzzles as you explore stunning and challenging environments. With no score, timer, or pressure, you can simply relax and enjoy the game. Join the adventure now and discover the joy of a rewarding and stress-free puzzle experience!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83e\udde944 well-balanced swap tile puzzles;<br></li><li>\u270f\ufe0f Handcrafted beautiful art;<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb5 Peaceful and relaxing gameplay atmosphere;<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfaf Many Achievements;<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc31 Easy to play.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wishlist it now!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807540/extras/30f1240e02e1a4a5234e34bbd5e7121b.avif?t=1728873838\" /></div><br><br><strong>Solve well-balanced swap tile puzzles</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807540/extras/4a00aba43ad0b5edfe79cb57e5d8095f.poster.avif?t=1728873838\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807540/extras/4a00aba43ad0b5edfe79cb57e5d8095f.webm?t=1728873838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807540/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1728873838\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807540/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1728873838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/