    "short_description": "Join a brave kitten on an amazing journey through stunning and challenging places. Solve well-crafted puzzles and help the little cat find his way to his friend. Enjoy a stress-free puzzle experience with no score, timer, or pressure. Start playing now!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201c\ud83d\udc4d It's a cute puzzle game, the music is simple and funny. After level 30 it got so hard that I had to use the hints to finish. I took long 3 hours, but I want to keep trying to finish it without using tips to get the last achievement.\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br><br>\u201c\ud83d\udc4d The game is very cute! Played up to lvl.22 and I enjoyed this game a lot! The game gives you many tips on the way and it has well-balanced puzzles. For its current price, it's totally worth it!\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br><br>\u201c\ud83d\udc4d A very decent game! If you enjoy relaxing cat themed puzzle games, this game is for you! It\u2019s quite enjoyable! It took me about 1.5 hour to finish it. I\u2019ll keep playing until I complete all the achievements!\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br>",
